            "fileSize": 26727481
          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers head to the Florida Keys to record the sound the silly whistling and clicking noises made by Bottlenose Dolphins — they sound just like humans giggling! After they get what they need for their podcast, they are confronted by hapless bad guy Cuckoo Clownfish, the ocean’s most unfunny clown who, despite his best efforts, is simply miserable at making anyone laugh. In fact, Cuckoo is tearing out precious sea grass from the ocean floor to entertain himself! The Seven Cs Solver app suggests COMMUNICATION as a way out of the predicament. The Soundtrekkers must show Cuckoo that destroying the ocean is NOT funny — but maybe telling jokes is!",
